00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:19.140
- Yeah, so we have a book coming out

00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:20.903
called Epoca: The Tree of Ecrof.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.750
It's about a young girl and a young boy

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:27.390
